---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Workspace — AI Web" description="Your AI Web stock research workspace.">
  <div class="app-shell" data-app-state="loading">
    <div class="app-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Private workspace</p><h1>What should we<br /><em>research next?</em></h1><p class="app-lede">Choose a supported stock to prepare a multi-agent research brief.</p></div><div class="credit-badge"><span>Credits</span><strong data-credits>—</strong></div></div>
    <div class="app-grid"><section class="workspace-card workspace-card--primary"><div class="card-topline"><span class="status-dot"></span><span>Ready when you are</span></div><form class="analyze-form" data-analyze-form><label for="app-symbol">Stock ticker</label><div class="analyze-controls"><div class="ticker-control"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input id="app-symbol" name="symbol" type="text" maxlength="8" placeholder="e.g. NVDA" /></div><button class="button button--primary" type="submit">Prepare analysis <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></div><p class="form-message" data-form-message aria-live="polite"></p></form><div class="app-note"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span><p>The complete run and progress experience is being shaped for the next product phase. No analysis is started from this preview.</p></div></section><section class="workspace-card account-card"><div class="account-card-heading"><span class="account-avatar account-avatar--large">◎</span><div><p class="eyebrow">Account</p><h2 data-user-name>Loading…</h2><p data-user-email>Checking session</p></div></div><button class="button button--quiet" type="button" data-sign-out>Sign out <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button><p class="form-message" data-account-message aria-live="polite"></p></section></div>
    <section class="history-section"><div class="section-heading section-heading--inline"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your research</p><h2>Recent analyses</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/pricing">Get more credits <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="history-list" data-history><div class="loading-state"><span class="loading-orb"></span><p>Loading your research history…</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="signed-out-state" data-signed-out hidden><div class="empty-illustration" aria-hidden="true">◎</div><h2>Sign in to open your workspace.</h2><p>Your credits and research history belong to your account.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/auth?returnTo=%2Fapp">Sign in <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
